      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5707,
      "text": "They will not hear therein vain talk or lies –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5708,
      "text": "a reward and a generous gift from your Lord[10],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5709,
      "text": "[from] the Lord of the heavens and earth and all that is between them, the Most Compassionate; none will dare to speak to Him[11].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5710,
      "text": "On the Day when the Spirit and the angels will stand in rows; none will dare to speak, except those to whom the Most Compassionate granted permission, and they will only speak the truth.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5711,
      "text": "That Day is sure to come. So whoever wills may seek a path leading to his Lord[12].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5712,
      "text": "Indeed, We have warned you of an imminent punishment on the Day when everyone will see what his hands have sent forth[13], and the disbeliever will say, “Oh, I wish that I were dust!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5713,
      "text": "By those who pull out [evil souls][1] harshly,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5714,
      "text": "and by those who draw out [good souls][2] gently,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5715,
      "text": "and by those who glide swiftly[3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5716,
      "text": "and those who overtake one another as in a race[4],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5717,
      "text": "and those who carry out the command [of Allah],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
