      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5720,
      "text": "hearts[5] will be pounding on that Day,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5721,
      "text": "and their eyes[6] will be downcast.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5722,
      "text": "They say, “Will we be brought back to life,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5723,
      "text": "after we have turned into decayed bones[7]?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5724,
      "text": "They say, “Then that would surely be a losing return[8]!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5725,
      "text": "It will only be a single Blast,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5726,
      "text": "then they will immediately be above the ground.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
